   "caption": "Five years ago, I launched the Hamilton Commission because I believe young people from all backgrounds belong in motorsport. Five years later I believe this more than ever. That’s why I’m so proud that last week, mission44 published Igniting Inclusion, a five year review of the progress that has been made across our sport and recommendations for the future. There’s no doubt that since 2021, our sport has changed for the better, but there’s still so much to be done. Head to Mission 44’s website to read the full report and help us drive change 💜",
